WEBVTT

00:00:03.189 --> 00:00:05.520
A closed shift shows its sales:

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:09.740
how many, the total, the cash kept, what was paid by card, by

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:12.889
gift card or balance, and what was refunded.

00:00:13.342 --> 00:00:14.874
And its cash drawer.

00:00:14.874 --> 00:00:19.058
The opening float, plus the cash put in, less what was taken out,

00:00:19.058 --> 00:00:22.122
gives the cash that should be there, Expected.

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:25.599
What staff counted is next to it, and the Difference.

00:00:25.599 --> 00:00:30.962
Each cash movement is listed with who made it, and why, and the shift's closing note.

